<title>USA: Pier 1 up on stock split.</title>
<headline>Pier 1 up on stock split.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of speciality retailer Pier 1 Imports rose Thursday after it declared a stock split.</p>
<p>Pier 1 added $1.06 to $26.50 in early morning trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Fort Worth, Texas-based Pier 1 announced a 3-for-2 stock split in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>Currently, Pier 1 has 45.1 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The quarterly dividend will be distributed Aug. 27 to holder of record on Aug. 13.</p>
